<Base title="Privacy" description="What Martin Gawlak Company keeps about you when you sign in, and why.">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Last updated November 26, 2026.</p>

    <p>One sign-in works across the Martin Gawlak Company sites, such as this one, Bandturo and DayorDollar.
      This page says what that sign-in keeps about you and what it is for. If something here is unclear,
      email <a href="mailto:hello@martingawlakcompany.com">hello@martingawlakcompany.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we keep</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your name and email address</strong>, so you can sign in and so the sites know who you are.</li>
      <li><strong>How you sign in</strong>: by an email code, or with Google. If you use Google, Google tells us your
        name, email address and profile picture, and nothing else. We never see your Google password.</li>
      <li><strong>Your active sign-ins</strong>: when each one started, and the IP address and browser it came from.
        This is how we keep you signed in and spot sign-ins that are not yours.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Each site keeps its own records of what you do there, such as a booking on Bandturo. Those stay with that site.</p>

    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not sell or rent your information.</li>
      <li>We do not show you ads based on it, or share it with advertisers.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who else handles it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> runs our servers and database, and sends the sign-in code emails.</li>
      <li><strong>Google</strong>, only if you choose to sign in with Google.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>A cookie keeps you signed in. We do not use cookies to track you across other websites.</p>

    <h2>Deleting your account</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@martingawlakcompany.com">hello@martingawlakcompany.com</a> from the address you
      sign in with, and we will delete your sign-in account and tell you when it is done.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Martin Gawlak Company, 131 North Second Street, Fort Pierce, Florida 34950 &middot;
      <a href="mailto:hello@martingawlakcompany.com">hello@martingawlakcompany.com</a> &middot;
      <a href="tel:+17722423534">(772) 242-3534</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
